{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_26", "source_id": "65cae15e000000002d002342", "title": "给油皮们试过了，这个底妆技巧真的巨贴脸！", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65cae15e000000002d002342", "topic_family": "彩妆与底妆", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1363, "evidence_unit_count": 41, "original_evidence_unit_count": 41, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 128, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["真的很服貼 貼到完全就像我的第二層皮膚一樣 姐們的新年好呀", "就可以輕輕鬆鬆的把那些死皮給帶下來 這樣子護膚之後呢 我們的皮膚底層是滋潤的", "有沒有姐妹在塗粉底液的時候 是這裡拍拍那裡拍拍 整整臉來回這樣拍來拍去的", "是不是又薄又透 最後就是定妝了 油皮的潔內一定一定要用 散粉來定妝", "按一按把那個油光吸附掉 這樣子一天下來 我們的臉都不會有大面積的脫妝 而且皮膚會看起來很乾淨", "就是服貼的跟第二層肌膚一樣 那我們話不多說馬上開始 首先是妝前的部分", "但是表面呢又不會顯得油糊糊 白天我會再塗一個防曬 那我們可以選擇這種"], "retained_quotes": ["就是服貼的跟第二層肌膚一樣 那我們話不多說馬上開始 首先是妝前的部分", "但是表面呢又不會顯得油糊糊 白天我會再塗一個防曬 那我們可以選擇這種"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65cae15e000000002d002342/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65cae15e000000002d002342/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65cae15e000000002d002342/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_65cae15e000000002d002342/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "d46767b7cb167dd8ade974baaca3b617719b5bb04d570d6549e5bffae811cd91", "card_hash": "7bf1d94fdf09d8e2bc36f58c54a7f93b73c4295ed35bd3c0a279f6e3da650a33", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
